    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How Low Can You Go?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aside from some other guys, YOU are your own worst enemy in this new time-attack runner--littleRedNina!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543230/extras/989ad9ed6abd857d015309de025cdec4.avif?t=1741598252\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dart littleRedNina in the direction of your choosing using the <strong>arrow-keys (or WASD)</strong>. See a wall? Miss a cycle and now you're flying into an enemy? Press <strong>SPACE</strong>\u00a0to come to a perfect halt!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you get the hang of moving around, make your way to the main mode: <strong>TIME ATTACK!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543230/extras/b559a5d898ebba61fff0d7549c640a48.avif?t=1741598252\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time Attack operates like this: you will play <strong>FIFTEEN\u00a0</strong>of the game's levels<strong>\u00a0</strong>in <strong>RANDOM ORDER.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543230/extras/aa31945242adc27eaccb44931663723c.avif?t=1741598252\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The<strong> goal of the game</strong> is to <strong>escape as fast as possible</strong>, <strong>with as many of your fifty lives as possible</strong>.\u00a0 Successfully avoiding taking damage from walls, and non-friendly objects will limit the accrual of penalty time. Your only friends here are your <strong>gold shurikens </strong>(...that are strictly props). Reclaim <strong>fifteen</strong> of those <strong>&quot;prized collectors' items&quot;</strong> to win the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543230/extras/75f095c7a69e820f0dff4d09a3e60fee.avif?t=1741598252\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing your run of fifteen levels, you can celebrate and view your results. As mentioned, there is a penalty for playing recklessly. Remember: <strong>quickly and carefully wins this race!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game also has a <strong>performance ranking system</strong>. Here are the current conditions to achieving them:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>! Rank = (0 lost lives AND &lt; 95 Score)\u00a0 &lt;-- Highest</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>S Rank = (&lt;5 lost lives AND &lt; 110 Score) </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Rank = (&lt;10 lost lives AND &lt; 125 Score) </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>B Rank = (&lt;15 lost lives AND &lt; 150 Score) </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>C Rank = (&lt;25 lost lives AND &lt; 200 Score) </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>else: D Rank\u00a0 &lt;-- Lowest</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having\u00a0<strong>30 levels</strong> to challenge with all kinds of possibilities, as well as high ranks and scores to fight for, this is  a game that you won't be able to put down. Put your mastery of mechanics and reflexes to the test in <strong>littleRedNina!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
